{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51195","headline":"五言白话诗 二 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生一代间，贫富不觉老。\n王役逼駈駈，走多换行少。\n（「换行少」，斯五四四一卷作「缘行步」。\n）他家马上坐，我身步擎草。\n种得果报缘，不须自烦恼。\n受报人中生，（自「受报人中生」以下，张锡厚另作一首。\n）本爲前身罪。\n今身不修福，痴愚脓血袋。\n病困卧着牀，悭心由不改。\n（「由」，斯五四四一卷作「犹」。\n）临死命欲终，𢗞财不忏悔\n身死妻後嫁，总将陪新壻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}